 * `adapters/actions/dispatch.ts`. The probe is the caller's just-written comment, when
 * it has one (`reload_environment`'s handoff comment): until the listing shows it, the
 * read may predate the write the claim rests on, and judging then would judge the
 * thread as it was before the caller spoke. Throws when the read fails, like every
